# R1 — nq-event-diffusion-research
#
# This repository holds the R1 research RECORD: the preregistration, the
# Owner-decision record, the trial identity, the PSMV code and the PSMV
# structural artifacts. It holds no market data and no outcome.

# --- generated caches -------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor noise ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
*.bak
*.orig

# --- MARKET DATA MUST NEVER ENTER THIS REPOSITORY ---------------------------
# R1 reads the purchased Databento data IN PLACE, under the OD-1 grant, from
# outside this project. Nothing derived from it beyond structural COUNTS may be
# stored here — that is what invariant L-13 and the PSMV artifacts are for.
# If a future file genuinely needs one of these extensions, it must be added
# deliberately with `git add -f` AND recorded in R1_TRIAL_REGISTRY.md; silence
# is not consent.
*.dbn
*.dbn.zst
*.zst
*.gz
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arrow
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

